window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>\"I was supposed to con him. Instead, he conned his way into my heart.\"</b></p> <p>Do you know what I should've said when my best friend plotted an epic con of the century?</p> <p>I should've said no.</p> <p>But since the foundation of friendship was built on having their back when they're being nuts, I said yes.</p> <p>She made me believe the plan was foolproof.</p> <p>Pretend to be her and go on the date set by her matchmaker.</p> <p>Turn it disastrous and reject the man.</p> <p>Except I wasn't prepared for the tall, tattooed god with a cocky smirk to walk in.</p> <p>My treacherous body came alive at the sight of him.</p> <p>Lusting after him was the opposite of the plan.</p> <p>Imagine my surprise when I succeeded with the mission, even though it hurt to walk away from him.</p> <p>I thought it was the last I'd ever see of him.</p> <p>Six months later, fate made us collide in the snowy mountain valleys of Switzerland.</p> <p>Our attraction was still sizzling as ever. But acting on it could be dangerous since there were one too many obstacles standing in our way.</p> <p>He was looking for a white picket fence, I wasn't.</p> <p>He thought I was my best friend—I wasn't.</p> <p>He believed in a happily ever after—I didn't.</p> <p>As if resisting the temptation wasn't enough, he stumbled on my very naughty list, bearing my deepest, darkest fantasies.</p> <p>Now he was hellbent on fulfilling them.</p> <p>One carnal,</p> <p>Filthy,</p> <p>Naughty treat at a time.</p> <p>In exchange, I go on a date with him for each one of them.</p> <p>Soon, the lines began blurring, and I did the one thing that wasn't on the list.</p> <p>Falling in love.</p> <p><i>This is a light, fun, and high-burn romance with a flirty hero who's hellbent on making her fall in love with him and a stubborn heroine who is scared of commitment, set during the holidays. There's forced proximity, boy-obsessed banter, romantic dates, and swoony romance.</i></p>"; 
